% * Profile
\subject{Profile}
Software Development Engineer with over 15 years of experience designing, implementing and supporting software solutions in various domains: finance, insurance, healthcare, energy, and automation. Extensive experience includes programming in  Java, JavaScript, Groovy, NodeJS, Python and other programming languages,  as well as work with Spring and Spring Boot, Quarkus, ME(AR)N ( Mongo Express React/Angular NodeJS), Docker, Kubernetes, Apache Camel, OSGi and other frameworks and tech stacks. Throughout my career I had to learn new environments, tools, libraries and perform roles ranging from Solution Architect to DevOps Engineer. Current areas of interest include micro-service and streaming data architectures, on-premise cloud and hybrid deployment models, domain specific languages.

\startitemize
  \item Delivered code and performed code review
  \item Provided guidance and shared technical knowledge with junior developers, related to cloud technology, aspects of configuring CI/CD or choosing data structure/algorithm for implementation
  \item Delivered technical design/documentation working as a mediator between developers and product owner
  \item Lead teams of developers and QA engineers navigating between  DevOps routines and POC implementation to clarify technical requirements
  \item Have prepared interviews strategies and conducted technical interviews with students on campus and with experienced professionals
\stopitemize

