\item Architecture and design documentation and DevOps for cloud infrastructure and CI/CD 
\item R\&D work, Proof-of-concept implementation and providing direction and support for the development 
 team
\item Integration and testing from QA to testing connectivity with third-party services (DataDog, Surescripts, eHealthExchange, etc)
