\blank

\Role{Senior Software Engineer}{Mar 2019 -- Mar 2021}
Development and support of modular based application platform for connected healthcare - ULP (Unified Landing Page). This platform was leveraging Liferay OSGi and portlet architecture to bring highly customizable applications to the clients - HIEs, providers and payers, integrating it into their software stack as well as provide best user experience and integration via SSO.

\startitemize
