\item R\& D and delivery of design documents for new features, in particular, leveraging portlets and OSGi architecture. 
\item Quality tests and Improvements in CI/CD process and transition from on on-premise type deployment to a cloud (AWS) deployment. 
\item Support and troubleshooting of the issues submitted by the customers and internal users
